,"/arc-plc/texas/hamilton-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, May to June and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025 the middle ran 46% of normal in February to March and 169% in June to July. Grid 13928 had its driest year in 1954 at 47% of normal. In 2026 so far, January to February came in at 52% of normal on the middle.</p>"}
